A||||3||NEFA||Join in New England area Event this weekend!!||||4||
Z||000000||NEFA||10-11-2001||02:22 PM||||The New England Fiero Association cordially invites you to attend our 2nd Annual "Leaf Peeper's Tour" on Saturday, October 13th, 2001 leaving from the parking lot of the Old Farms Hotel in Avon, CT (http://www.avonoldfarmshotel.com). Plan to meet at 9:30 am, as the cruise starts promptly at 10:00 am. Travel with us as we wind our way up, in, and through the mountains of Western Mass., concluding the <BR>cruise at the Yankee Candle Factory and Auto Museum in South Deerfield, MA (http://www.yankeecandle.com). All are welcome and encouraged to cruise with us, and I look forward to seeing everyone there!<BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nefa_logo.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/calendar.htm" TARGET=_blank>Upcoming Club Events</A> <P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/tshirt.html" TARGET=_blank>Get your Club T-shirt</A>||||reg||4
