Z||000003||Fiero5||10-12-2001||05:52 PM||||I hope that we can see a nice turnout of Fiero owners, as this will probably be the last big Fiero event in the New England area for this year. Whether you are in a club or just enjoy your Fiero in your own way, we would love to have you. This is open to all Fiero enthusiasts. I am sure we all agree that we have a great time driving and showing off our Fieros. With the great leaf colors that are out there right now, as most areas are reaching peak color as we speak, we have the ingredients for having nothing but tons of fun. We will enjoy some great foliage sight seeing along the way, tons of photo opportunities with all our Fieros and the beautiful backdrop of all the fall colors. Added the Yankee Candle factory at the end and we have the mixture for an awesome day.<P>Hope to see lots of you Fiero nuts there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Steve<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nefa_logo.gif"> ||||reg||6
